 **Parameters:**
-- Camera FOV: 20 degrees (example from helper implementation) [S6, unofficial].
-- Aspect Ratio: 1.77 (example from helper implementation) [S6, unofficial].
-- Near Plane: 0.5 (example from helper implementation) [S6, unofficial].
